### Fetch repos
POST http://127.0.0.1:8778/api/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "command": "fetch",
    "repo_name": "all"
}


### Fetch token
POST http://127.0.0.1:8778/api/get_token
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "secret": "un_client_secret"
}




